  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Dandora Dumpsite Rehabilitation Group (DADREG)Project Title: &apos;Empowering Women/ Girls Access Skills and education&apos; Project Objective: To promote the economic and education wellbeing and social integration of 150  youths, women and girls in Dandora informal settlements  including those working in the Dandora dumpsite, giving them a chance to access quality training programs to make them competitive in the job market and self-reliant Project Activities: Training of women and youth on business skills, payment of school tuition fee, and distribution of monthly food support to identified families</narrative>
  </description>
